{
  "_comment": [
    "The PIN MANIFEST for the local tier: exactly which inference runtime, which",
    "service wrapper and which model files `huginn local on` may install, with the",
    "sha256 every download is verified against before it is unpacked or served.",
    "",
    "scripts/gen-local-manifest.js embeds this into client/huginn-local between",
    "GENERATED markers (the gen-device-policy.js precedent), so the one fetched",
    "file carries its own pins and there is no second fetch to substitute. A",
    "runtime or model bump is therefore BY CONSTRUCTION a reviewed cli-v* release",
    "— there is no other path, and that is the gated-bump doctrine: the named",
    "failure mode is a routine upstream patch silently degrading a GPU box to CPU.",
    "",
    "Model sha256s come from the Hugging Face LFS metadata (lfs.oid IS the",
    "sha256); runtime hashes were computed from the downloaded assets at pin time.",
    "Every class carries exactly one chat model and one embed model. G16 hardware",
    "is detected and reported, but installs the G8 plan — no 14B row ships until",
    "a real G16 use exists.",
    "",
    "Licenses ride here so a bump cannot quietly pull in a restrictive one:",
    "weights are pulled from the vendor at activation, never redistributed."
  ],
